For your project “PocketSmart AI – Your Smart Budget Recommendation Assistant,” you can present the Brainstorming & Ideation Phase like this:

💡 Brainstorming & Ideation Phase

Problem Identified:
Many people struggle to manage their monthly income, control unnecessary spending, and decide how much money to allocate to different needs.

Core Idea:
Develop PocketSmart AI, an intelligent budget recommendation assistant that analyzes a user's income, expenses, financial goals, and spending patterns to provide personalized budgeting suggestions.

Key Ideas Generated
💰 Income & Expense Tracking – Record and categorize income and expenses.
📊 Smart Budget Recommendations – AI suggests suitable spending limits for categories such as food, transport, shopping, and entertainment.
🤖 Personalized AI Advice – Recommendations adapt to the user's spending habits and goals.
🎯 Goal-Based Budgeting – Help users plan for goals such as education, travel, emergency funds, or major purchases.
🚨 Overspending Alerts – Notify users when their spending approaches or exceeds a budget.
📈 Spending Analytics – Show charts and summaries of where money is being spent.
💡 Saving Suggestions – Identify potential areas where users could reduce discretionary spending.
🔮 Future Expense Prediction – Estimate upcoming expenses based on previous spending patterns.
🗣️ AI Chat Assistant – Allow users to ask questions such as “Can I afford to spend ₹2,000 this week?”
🔐 Privacy & Security – Protect users' financial information.
Ideation Flow

User Problem → Research → Brainstorming → Feature Ideas → Group & Analyze → Select Features → Prototype → Test

Proposed Solution

PocketSmart AI combines expense tracking + AI-based analysis + personalized recommendations + financial goals into one assistant, helping users make informed budgeting decisions.
